irl called Yuki\nThe boy decided to return it to her.\n<br><br>\nNext morning, he ran in the snow to a village and saw many boys and girls singing cheerfully. When he came to a small house, he saw a girl sitting alone on the veranda. She said, \"I am Yuki. Who are you?\" He handed a ball to her without an answer. She was very glad and said \" I was looking for it. My sickly mother made this for me. Thank you very much.\" That gave him relief and they become friends.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Kyowa Film)","duration":22,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":1995},"episodes":1,"externalLinks":[{"language":null,"site":"Official Site","type":"INFO","url":"http://www.kyowafilm.com/oninoko.htm"}],"genres":["Fantasy"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":55,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"MOVIE","rank":27,"season":null,"type":"RATED","year":1995},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"MOVIE","rank":30,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":1995}],"relations":[],"season":null,"seasonYear":null,"source":"ORIGINAL","startDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":1995},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":4,"score":10},{"amount":4,"score":20},{"amount":6,"score":30},{"amount":8,"score":40},{"amount":17,"score":50},{"amount":22,"score":60},{"amount":22,"score":70},{"amount":6,"score":80},{"amount":2,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":11,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":91,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":141,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":12,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":2,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"FINISHED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[],"synonyms":["Goblin and \"Yuki Usagi\" (Snow Hare)","Snow Hare"],"title":{"english":null,"native":"鬼の子とゆきうさぎ","romaji":"Oni no Ko to Yuki Usagi"},"trailer":null,"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793706104},"21167":{"al":20506,"bannerImage":null,"coverImage":{"color":"#d6c978","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/la